@startuml
skinparam {
  ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BoundaryBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ControlBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  EntityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ActorBorderColor black
  BoundaryBorderColor black
  ControlBorderColor black
  EntityBorderColor black
  DatabaseBorderColor black
}

actor User
boundary "Reading History" as UI
boundary Router
control ChapterController
control ChapterService
entity HistoryModel
entity ChapterModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Request last read chapter
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. GET /api/chapter/history/{userId}/{storyId}
activate Router

Router -> ChapterController: 3. getLastReadChapterFromHistory()
activate ChapterController

ChapterController -> ChapterService: 4. getLastReadChapterFromHistory(userId, storyId)
activate ChapterService

ChapterService -> HistoryModel: 5. findOne(user_id, story_id)
activate HistoryModel
HistoryModel -> MongoDB: 6. query history
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> HistoryModel: 7. history doc
deactivate MongoDB

HistoryModel -> ChapterModel: 8. populate(last_read_chapter)
activate ChapterModel
ChapterModel -> MongoDB: 9. query chapter
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> ChapterModel: 10. chapter data
deactivate MongoDB
ChapterModel --> HistoryModel: 11. populated chapter
deactivate ChapterModel

HistoryModel --> ChapterService: 12. return history + last_read_chapter
deactivate HistoryModel

ChapterService --> ChapterController: 13. return result
deactivate ChapterService

ChapterController --> Router: 14. HTTP response
deactivate ChapterController

Router --> UI: 15. Response data
deactivate Router
UI --> User: 16. Show last read chapter
deactivate UI
deactivate User
@enduml
